        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Lung rianramei khanga,",
            "Ai kapma kalang bam pui ram e;",
            "Tabui nung manni cho?",
            "Ai nkhuan ngam mak ge,",
            "Tabui nung ruina tang nina cho?",
            "Kanloumei gai pui ram khou bam khang.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He! tingsang gai pui ram khou,",
            "Ai bam ni e (2) gaichui pui ram khou,",
            "Rianra guai thao o,",
            "Nthanmei guai bam pui ram khou,",
            "Tingkau Laujiu Nah le bam cham ni,",
            "",
            "2. Kandih rianra pui ram,",
            "Seitan rih tanna bam pui ram khou;",
            "Lungbam khang kabam mak,",
            "Achun suna mikdui Luanga,",
            "Ai ning pui ram gaimei khou,",
            "He! bumang thanmei leh jai lou o.",
            "",
            "3. Neilamei jianmei nun,",
            "Tingsang gai pui ram guang tang ngam the;",
            "Hallelujah! Amen,",
            "Jai gut lou o pou rui,",
            "Tingkau gai pui ram khou 9!@ bam khang,",
            "Tingkau laujiu Nah le bam cham khang.",
            "",
            "4. Kandih khou rianra na,",
            "Kapmei mikdui thut phui than lou ni,",
            "Tingkau Laujiu Nah rui;",
            "Kagan guang tang mak khou,",
            "Poubaumei ta nkhuan ngam mak ge,",
            "Thei na ringthau datmei ram gaimei."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
